# Ayurveda Intelligence — System Architecture

> Project: Ayurveda Intelligence — Evidence-Aware Ayurvedic Formulation Discovery
> Purpose: Hackathon Prototype
> Architecture Status: Prototype / Incremental Development

---

## 1. End-to-End System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB

    %% =========================================================
    %% USER LAYER
    %% =========================================================

    U["User / Researcher"]

    UI["Web Application<br/>Search & Knowledge Interface"]

    U -->|"Disease / symptom / common term"| UI


    %% =========================================================
    %% INPUT PROCESSING
    %% =========================================================

    IP["STAGE 1 — INPUT PROCESSING<br/><br/>
    Text cleaning<br/>
    Case normalization<br/>
    Basic tokenization"]

    UI --> IP


    %% =========================================================
    %% TERMINOLOGY INTELLIGENCE
    %% =========================================================

    TR["STAGE 2 — TERMINOLOGY RESOLUTION<br/><br/>
    Synonym lookup<br/>
    Common → canonical terminology<br/>
    Ayurvedic terminology mapping<br/>
    Match type detection"]

    SYN["synonyms.csv<br/><br/>
    Canonical terms<br/>
    Common names<br/>
    Alternative terminology"]

    IP --> TR
    SYN --> TR


    %% =========================================================
    %% DISEASE IDENTIFICATION
    %% =========================================================

    DI["STAGE 3 — CONDITION IDENTIFICATION<br/><br/>
    Identify canonical disease / condition<br/>
    Match disease record<br/>
    Retrieve description"]

    DIS["diseases.csv<br/><br/>
    Disease ID<br/>
    Canonical name<br/>
    Common name<br/>
    Description"]

    TR --> DI
    DIS --> DI


    %% =========================================================
    %% KNOWLEDGE RETRIEVAL
    %% =========================================================

    KR["STAGE 4 — KNOWLEDGE RETRIEVAL<br/><br/>
    Retrieve associated formulations<br/>
    Generate candidate results<br/>
    Match condition ↔ formulation"]

    FORM["formulations.csv<br/><br/>
    Formulation ID<br/>
    Name<br/>
    Formulation type<br/>
    Associated condition<br/>
    Usage context"]

    DI --> KR
    FORM --> KR


    %% =========================================================
    %% FUTURE INGREDIENT LAYER
    %% =========================================================

    ING["INGREDIENT KNOWLEDGE<br/><br/>
    Formulation ingredients<br/>
    Ingredient properties<br/>
    Rasa / Guna / Virya / Vipaka"]

    KR -.->|"Future extension"| ING


    %% =========================================================
    %% RANKING
    %% =========================================================

    RANK["STAGE 5 — CANDIDATE RANKING<br/><br/>
    Terminology match<br/>
    Condition match<br/>
    Context match<br/>
    Evidence availability<br/>
    Prototype match score"]

    KR --> RANK


    %% =========================================================
    %% EXPLAINABILITY
    %% =========================================================

    XAI["STAGE 6 — EXPLAINABILITY ENGINE<br/><br/>
    Why was this result shown?<br/>
    Match path<br/>
    Scoring breakdown<br/>
    Matched terminology<br/>
    Associated condition"]

    RANK --> XAI


    %% =========================================================
    %% EVIDENCE
    %% =========================================================

    REF["EVIDENCE / REFERENCES<br/><br/>
    Source metadata<br/>
    Classical references<br/>
    Literature references<br/>
    Evidence provenance"]

    XAI -.->|"Future evidence layer"| REF


    %% =========================================================
    %% RESULT ASSEMBLY
    %% =========================================================

    RES["RESULT ASSEMBLY<br/><br/>
    Normalized term<br/>
    Identified condition<br/>
    Ranked formulations<br/>
    Match score<br/>
    Explanation<br/>
    Evidence status"]

    XAI --> RES
    REF -.-> RES


    %% =========================================================
    %% FRONTEND OUTPUT
    %% =========================================================

    OUT["RESULT INTERFACE<br/><br/>
    Formulation cards<br/>
    Why this result?<br/>
    Formulation details<br/>
    Evidence trail"]

    RES --> OUT
    OUT --> U


    %% =========================================================
    %% FUTURE ML / NLP
    %% =========================================================

    NLP["FUTURE NLP / ML LAYER<br/><br/>
    Semantic search<br/>
    Entity recognition<br/>
    Transliteration handling<br/>
    Context-aware matching<br/>
    Learning-based ranking"]

    TR -.->|"Future enhancement"| NLP
    DI -.->|"Future enhancement"| NLP
    RANK -.->|"Future enhancement"| NLP


    %% =========================================================
    %% MONITORING / LOGGING
    %% =========================================================

    LOG["APPLICATION LOGGING<br/><br/>
    Search queries<br/>
    Normalization results<br/>
    Retrieval results<br/>
    Errors / warnings"]

    UI -.-> LOG
    RES -.-> LOG
